      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "In Utah, severe winter snow loads, intense summer UV rays, and rapid freeze-thaw cycles mean standard asphalt shingle roofs often fail around 20 years of age. Key warning signs you need a replacement include curling or missing shingles, heavy granule loss in gutters, water stains on ceilings, a sagging roof deck, and daylight visible through attic boards.",
        "snippet_highlighted_words": [
          "curling or missing shingles, heavy granule loss in gutters, water stains on ceilings, a sagging roof deck, and daylight visible through attic boards"
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          0,
          1,
          2,
          3,
          4
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Age and Exterior Wear"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Age past 20 years: Utah's extreme thermal cycling shortens standard shingle lifespans."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Curling or buckling:\nShingle edges turning up or middle areas bubbling from moisture and heat damage."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Missing or cracked tabs: High winds common in Utah canyons easily tear loose brittle shingles."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Granule buildup:\nDark, sand-like granules piling up in your rain gutters show the protective coating is gone."
          }
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          5,
          9,
          10
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Interior and Structural Red Flags"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Attic leaks or water stains: Brown spots or damp wood in the attic during heavy rain or melting snow."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Sagging rooflines:\nA drooping or wavy ridge line points to rotted or broken support decking below."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Daylight in the attic: Sunlight shining through roof boards means severe structural gaps."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Higher energy bills:\nHeat escaping through a failing roof system causes your heating or cooling costs to jump."
          }
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          6,
          7,
          8,
          9
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "If you want to move forward, tell me:"
